WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.992
JASON! BRIAN JUST LOCKED
EVERY EXIT... AND HE'S ALREADY LEAVING!

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.624
He gave me a place to stay...
I work for him. He wouldn't sell me out.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.108
Then why did he leave us here?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.848
JASON! GET OUT! I'm hearing
Coast Guard traffic... FIB units are
moving on Brian's boatyard.
THEY KNOW YOU'RE THERE!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.008
Wait... LOOK AT THAT SCREEN.
Brian locked us inside himself!

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.440
BRIAN! OPEN THE GATES!
WHAT DID I DO?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.880
Sorry, kid. One name keeps
this whole operation clean.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:41.590
Oh no... Brian didn't just
abandon us. HE SOLD JASON'S
LOCATION TO THE FIB!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.296
I gave them your location, Jason.
They gave me my freedom.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.288
You used me...

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.520
JASON DUVAL! STEP AWAY
FROM THE DOOR. TELL US WHERE
LUCIA CAMINOS IS!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.160
Jason... THEY KNOW
ABOUT LUCIA.

